{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0440_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0440_story_02_synopsis", "source_sha256": "4cd9880d3eb20c63e7b1f5a8ec5a72f96adb473f8789c67e6c1e2c03df899d36", "ja": "2社それぞれのメンバーに分かれ、挨拶に向\nかうアイドル達。各会社のメインビジュアル\nを決めることになり、『スカジ』は朋花が、\n『ミラス・ミラン』は可憐が務めることに。", "zh": "偶像们兵分两路前往2家公司打招呼。\n期间决定了各公司的主视觉图人选，\n“斯卡蒂”由朋花担任，\n“米拉斯·米兰”则由可怜担任。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0440_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0440_story_02_1000_p", "source_sha256": "1d3ae0345ccf196d727e22261dabb0ace7239b9e4cac854c7b6a727bb180252a", "ja": "（メンバーの割り振りが決定し、それぞれの\n日本法人に顔見せに赴くことになった。まずは……）", "zh": "（成员分配已经确定，也决定要分别去各自的日本法人露面。首先是……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0440_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0440_story_02_1001_031tom", "source_sha256": "c96d7f8522f25485b5ff052883508f951b5f628eb70b415e80c062cd04abaa8e", "ja": "よろしくお願いします～。", "zh": "请多关照～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0440_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0440_story_02_1002_052kao", "source_sha256": "f45d7ffa6c147b3598ad14b10a7e34ad20a6bdfb0139c448e065cc8112c13fd1", "ja": "よろしくお願いします。", "zh": "请多指教了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0440_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0440_story_02_1003_006mak", "source_sha256": "09dcc9e3a7e5bf6d98f080b9091dce3824a9dc6fe92048af6d244a3d392465d1", "ja": "よろしくお願いしますっ！", "zh": "请多关照！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0440_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0440_story_02_1004_sukajikouhou", "source_sha256": "3d74680e5f1cd00f0690d81f3c7d0ded477db6ab4f1258c420912160441a15ff", "ja": "本日はお越しいただき、ありがとうございます。\nお仕事の話をさせていただく前に、一つ……", "zh": "感谢您今天的到来。\n在谈工作之前，先说一件事……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0440_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0440_story_02_1005_sukajikouhou", "source_sha256": "077e400d0f9629d014b751ed493ff8230063d4425a4945df05b4682d3cb532e0", "ja": "皆様は、ワタクシどものブランドについて、\nどの程度ご存じでいらっしゃいますか？", "zh": "各位对我们的品牌了解多少呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0440_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0440_story_02_1006_006mak", "source_sha256": "44279b382df25dea748c119a80965bf8d4bfdbb7b53e05ccca001947101bcc78", "ja": "え、ええと……すみません！\nすっごく有名！ってことは知ってるんですけど……。", "zh": "呃、那个……对不起！\n我只知道这个品牌非常有名……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0440_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0440_story_02_1007_031tom", "source_sha256": "304e36c984620c10fbdd28a523ce3a269f7ee6a5dea3e44c707a20bba35a5c22", "ja": "私も、それほどは～。\n今日のために、多少は予習してきましたが～。", "zh": "我也没那么了解啦～\n不过为了今天，还是稍微预习了一下～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0440_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0440_story_02_1008_052kao", "source_sha256": "f7eb2006c0f41c220fbadf9bb37bce24a76d413fd0609ed5d76b6b031ccb1066", "ja": "私も……北欧発祥のメゾン、というくらいで、\n成り立ちや歴史までは存じ上げなくて。", "zh": "我也……只是知道它是源自北欧的品牌，\n至于品牌的由来和历史，就不太了解了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0440_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0440_story_02_1009_sukajikouhou", "source_sha256": "31a7ecfb0d3d2e50a42e72f48d9b02bd04dd2cd6a2e21a73cd6eeb7864409f1c", "ja": "いえ、問題ありません。\n率直なご意見をありがとうございます。", "zh": "不，没关系的。\n非常感谢您直率的意见。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0440_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0440_story_02_1010_sukajikouhou", "source_sha256": "9c099c2866ff225923250111a2533e9af9bddae9edfdb9f08ac85f3a31bc7c52", "ja": "特に学生の皆様などは、機会がないでしょうし。\n差し支えなければ、ご説明させていただいても？", "zh": "尤其是学生们，应该没什么机会吧。\n如果您不介意的话，可以让我来为您说明吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0440_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0440_story_02_1011_p", "source_sha256": "2c166157d87b564d6c59ebf97de412be5b44e3af5d8604eb02170933a17c22b6", "ja": "それはありがたい。是非お願いします。", "zh": "那真是太感谢了。请务必告诉我。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0440_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0440_story_02_1012_052kao", "source_sha256": "74302dfdfed6b589a85c9482f6d3fc8036462b8ef887ad0e8cb21adf313cd271", "ja": "まあ。ブランドの方に直接教えていただけるなんて、\nとっても貴重な機会になりそう……。", "zh": "哎呀，竟然能直接听品牌方为我们讲解，真是非常难得的机会……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0440_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0440_story_02_1013_sukajikouhou", "source_sha256": "87fdddffa48fda1249d40d33439131519f8e9eb8981dbd218fe2defd5337cac5", "ja": "ブランド名の『スカジ』は、女神の名前です。その名を\n冠する我々も、静けさと威厳をテーマとしています。", "zh": "品牌名“斯卡蒂”是女神的名字。冠以这个名字的我们，也以静谧与威严为主题。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0440_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0440_story_02_1014_sukajikouhou", "source_sha256": "d26cf8565f751a4b040923299c61b8a8e12861654e3c8761b7b4d1ea38762ede", "ja": "伝統的な毛皮職人をルーツに持つため、トナカイ革や\nウールなど、素材への敬意は欠かしません。", "zh": "由于拥有传统毛皮工匠的渊源，始终对驯鹿皮革、羊毛等材料抱有敬意。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0440_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0440_story_02_1015_006mak", "source_sha256": "4be4209495720637c4a767ae823088c425db8088101ae687d72448a572afbad0", "ja": "気高く麗しい女神、かぁ……\nくぅ……カッコイイ！", "zh": "高贵美丽的女神啊……  \n呜……好帅气！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0440_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0440_story_02_1016_sukajikouhou", "source_sha256": "00790e52fddd267a5bdb06f27065cd177a8fe4f0c7734b30101352e48379826b", "ja": "氷と森、光のコントラスト。主張は強くなくとも、\n佇まいで風格を示す。それこそが、我々のメゾン。", "zh": "冰与森林、光的对比。即使不刻意张扬，\n也能以风姿彰显格调。这正是我们的时装屋。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0440_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0440_story_02_1017_sukajikouhou", "source_sha256": "15afc6cbffde5bfc92e86aabdb7f0dfaad751ba92f3c2f65eb7fdf02ab8bdd26", "ja": "騒がしさの対極に位置するラグジュアリー、\nそんな空気感を掴んでいただければ、と……以上です。", "zh": "如果能感受到这种与喧闹截然相反的奢华氛围……我想表达的就是这些。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0440_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0440_story_02_1018_031tom", "source_sha256": "9808219afab72616132116e6c2a274d14c86eb5e7400d64e949718c247f52074", "ja": "ありがとうございます～、勉強になりました～。", "zh": "非常感谢～，真是受教了～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0440_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0440_story_02_1019_sukajikouhou", "source_sha256": "aa2db80628835f1b94f30e9f78a32e4b2906dc9045090955a5696ffe9338d598", "ja": "いえ……これは少々、個人的な話になるのですが。\nワタクシは元々、皆様のファンなんです。", "zh": "不……这只是我的一点私事罢了。\n我原本就是各位的粉丝。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0440_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0440_story_02_1020_006mak", "source_sha256": "4e052cd3aded760d0c75fc9ba3bd1f92c27e7eac27a551cd277fdce0d4abd4cd", "ja": "えっ、そうなんですか？　光栄だなぁ。", "zh": "咦，是这样吗？真是我的荣幸啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0440_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0440_story_02_1021_sukajikouhou", "source_sha256": "1a4759fd4dc3215ce540d048ef10061d9c5a8a3fb03b8a7c68e89cb77c0688cb", "ja": "はい。ですので、ご希望があれば\nいくらでもお手伝いさせていただきます。", "zh": "好的。因此，如果您有需要，我愿意尽力帮忙。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0440_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0440_story_02_1022_052kao", "source_sha256": "7a6187f74b3234904243bbc14282c84ab759511391ce2f4d274aced795cd7fe9", "ja": "そこまで言っていただけて、とても嬉しいです。\nご期待に添えられるよう、頑張りますね。", "zh": "您能这样说，我真的非常开心。\n为了不辜负您的期待，我会努力的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0440_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0440_story_02_1023_p", "source_sha256": "93e0fd5961c9ab9f51ee0d4c2fc05d9c42ded92642f555a58ffca81d2ef53341", "ja": "っと、それで……今日は3人から、メインビジュアルを\n決めようと思うのですが、お考えはありますか？", "zh": "嗯，那么……今天想从3人中选出主视觉人选，您有什么想法吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0440_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0440_story_02_1024_sukajikouhou", "source_sha256": "16529c453000ba9f62baab8fce905367599cc8273222cb34f1b0cc706d793a46", "ja": "はい。悩みましたが……\nここは、天空橋様にお願いできればと思います。", "zh": "好的。我虽然犹豫了一下……\n但这里还是想拜托天空桥大人。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0440_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0440_story_02_1025_031tom", "source_sha256": "1a453cfe15a756ec8654672a46ffe16336cc4ad4743aeaf27ddb51b1ac25cdfa", "ja": "私ですか～……？", "zh": "我吗～……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0440_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0440_story_02_1026_sukajikouhou", "source_sha256": "448b6126dd4df42a08de2210640a079ce0483bdffd95319de88d81bb7d66b3ef", "ja": "天空橋様が纏う峻厳な気迫は、我々のプロダクトに\n最適かと。いかがでしょうか？　天空橋様。", "zh": "天空桥小姐身上散发出的严峻气魄，与我们的产品\n可以说是绝配。您意下如何呢？天空桥小姐。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0440_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0440_story_02_1027_031tom", "source_sha256": "19d21418c0dbefa31e909d90068c2859fa5f20a9d1816defe1a8eca04736d66d", "ja": "……。わかりました～。\nご指名いただけた以上、全力を尽くすまで。", "zh": "……我明白了～。\n既然承蒙指名，我会竭尽全力。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0440_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0440_story_02_1028_031tom", "source_sha256": "4bfe074f394f262878e7b215a9cea7a9852730f043b432e68ec2e35e56f72f74", "ja": "そのご提案、お引き受けいたしましょう～。", "zh": "那么，我就接受您的提议吧～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0440_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0440_story_02_1029_null", "source_sha256": "efc1d82f27c00c2cd66242ba3968b75b5084f0ad635f478df59f2ea4ca40369e", "ja": "そして……", "zh": "然后……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0440_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0440_story_02_1030_mirasumirankouhou", "source_sha256": "cdf316648986cac5950e6e00701939f89abc4fef54156734b59c1a9fde96ac3e", "ja": "わぁ、本物だ～♪　……っとと！\n失礼いたしました。皆様、ミラス・ミランへようこそ！", "zh": "哇，是真的～♪……哎呀！\n失礼了。各位，欢迎来到ミラス・ミラン！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0440_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0440_story_02_1031_021mat", "source_sha256": "1fb0cc9efc0ea1a4de3b1db599f89d0539ef28bda6d8405e7f5f57ff599bd1fb", "ja": "こんにちは、なのです！\nお招きいただき、ありがとうなのです～。", "zh": "你好呀！谢谢邀请我来做客～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0440_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0440_story_02_1032_034ayu", "source_sha256": "60f30a4d37aafb2f5a7b5f463ae0df250391cfbcfbee337a68efa86c78fe0fb2", "ja": "ど、どうも！　あは、あはは……\nきょ、今日はよろしくお願いします！", "zh": "那、那个，你好！啊哈、啊哈哈……\n今、今天请多关照！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0440_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0440_story_02_1033_045kar", "source_sha256": "5075cad14b9c027ce14a0bf43bf3a80a4ae2b185363c7be83970ac3f22d628ef", "ja": "うぅ……お、お願いします……！", "zh": "呜……请、请多关照……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0440_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0440_story_02_1034_mirasumirankouhou", "source_sha256": "338aafd4205bd3a69c2e8cf383165edc55ab279aad0163813dc60d20ca59e07c", "ja": "あら……舞浜様、篠宮様、どうなさいました？\nいささか、お顔が引きつっていらっしゃるような……。", "zh": "哎呀……舞滨小姐、筱宫小姐，你们怎么了吗？\n脸色似乎稍微有点僵硬呢……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0440_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0440_story_02_1035_p", "source_sha256": "1b6140a187940c0cb65cafe6510491098c8ccb97fababb0413aafb16f9dd302e", "ja": "す、すみません……。\n二人とも、緊張してるのか？", "zh": "对、对不起……  \n你们两个，是不是有点紧张？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0440_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0440_story_02_1036_034ayu", "source_sha256": "075c25b3e2f50afdc19adef5dbf920459e02c19d857175686d1feee8fda0358a", "ja": "だ、だってさぁ！　あそこのバッグの値段とか、\n{$P$}のボーナスくらいだよね！？", "zh": "因、因为啊！那边那个包的价格，差不多就是{$P$}的奖金吧！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0440_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0440_story_02_1037_p", "source_sha256": "39d3c1ab1d67afc5c6dbe5e01006453ecdff1af21402e7cc433ba10310a103ad", "ja": "いや……年収……。", "zh": "不对……是年收入……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0440_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0440_story_02_1038_045kar", "source_sha256": "3daa31451378a0863d767722e21133ebe11fadb555808cdd20071c9a0218c3c1", "ja": "引っかけて落としちゃったら、とか……\nか、考えちゃって……うぅ。", "zh": "要是碰一下掉在地上摔坏了，该怎么办……\n一、一想到这个……呜呜。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0440_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0440_story_02_1039_mirasumirankouhou", "source_sha256": "47c952f5529daab9cc1f48fd97b3da1cb26601301ed34d2c5efa1a4b7de96ea1", "ja": "まあまあ～、どうかお気になさらず。\nわたくしどもの品は、そんなにヤワではありません。", "zh": "好啦好啦～，请您不必在意。\n敝店的商品可没有那么娇气。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0440_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0440_story_02_1040_mirasumirankouhou", "source_sha256": "ad95c8c7313159d89af0b268124d7db85512f85af58164f5d6881d99d6215f91", "ja": "ファッションとは、動く彫刻……\nそれが私たち、ミラス・ミランのテーマですから！", "zh": "时尚就是会动的雕塑……  \n因为那正是我们Mirasu Miran的主题！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0440_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0440_story_02_1041_021mat", "source_sha256": "059d78e6e9646b06c5b6c88ed0360d317805ced0cd50234740435715ee1af154", "ja": "動く彫刻……まるで、魔法みたいなのですね。\nわんだほー！なのです。", "zh": "活动的雕塑……简直就像魔法一样呢。\n太棒啦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0440_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0440_story_02_1042_mirasumirankouhou", "source_sha256": "c5e8f527f67a4b9930bce656370ad1ee28443b4caeab7a5cb763b175e9cdeebb", "ja": "ふふ♪　魔法の国のプリンセスでいらっしゃる\n徳川様には、まさにピッタリですよね！", "zh": "呵呵♪ 对身为魔法王国公主的德川大人来说，真是再合适不过了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0440_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0440_story_02_1043_mirasumirankouhou", "source_sha256": "15a10067cfd13b96e80b304fa3a1adb360d0d9017567c504eb936a1186437fb0", "ja": "いえ、徳川様だけではなく……お三方それぞれが、\nミラス・ミランに相応しい魅力をお持ちです。", "zh": "不，不仅是德川大人……三位各自身上，\n都具备与米拉斯·米兰相称的魅力。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0440_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0440_story_02_1044_034ayu", "source_sha256": "f6bb20b71ca3ae2b535a5852fbc9410d7577379f38721be45b95a8b65bad2536", "ja": "え、アタシも？　けどアタシ、\nハイブランドとか持ったことないですけど……。", "zh": "诶，我也有？可是我从来没用过什么高级品牌……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0440_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0440_story_02_1045_mirasumirankouhou", "source_sha256": "ff7eaace34705c1d70afc054f50ad0f0cd6edb7533313d362269b104b7bcc554", "ja": "舞浜様の、ダンサブルな躍動感……\nそれはわたくしどもの理念に通じる、一つの芸術。", "zh": "舞滨小姐那充满舞蹈感的活力……\n那是与我们理念相通的一种艺术。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0440_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0440_story_02_1046_034ayu", "source_sha256": "4025170b1e2363e5024426e2c36429fe41b91187a5aa375f617a491d103c2a5d", "ja": "げ、芸術！？　そこまで言われると、\nちょっと照れちゃうな……え、えへへ♪", "zh": "艺、艺术！？被夸到这个份上，我都有点不好意思了……诶、嘿嘿♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0440_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0440_story_02_1047_mirasumirankouhou", "source_sha256": "4bcdc44f177ebd111b2174dac580d2584a964abcd00ecb26beb635447c7edb05", "ja": "そして……篠宮様。貴女様こそが、わたくしども\nミラス・ミランを体現する方だと思うんです。", "zh": "然后……篠宫大人。我认为，您正是体现出我们米拉斯·米兰的人。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0440_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0440_story_02_1048_045kar", "source_sha256": "729230176ccdd9e48e9a27d60d86b99cf6ffb646b46b8ecee51017c145052649", "ja": "え、ええっ！？　わ、私がですか……？", "zh": "诶、诶！？我、我吗……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0440_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0440_story_02_1049_mirasumirankouhou", "source_sha256": "a723672f81b67722aec93c85dc13cafff0dc2ba166c6248e48cac98dff633eb7", "ja": "はい。張り詰めるほど完ぺきに作られた外面と、\nその内側に秘めた、儚さと情熱……", "zh": "是的。外表完美得令人屏息，而在那内里隐藏着的，是短暂易逝与热情……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0440_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0440_story_02_1050_mirasumirankouhou", "source_sha256": "f853169333722fcfa45e3b44bbf3f3c4f6784ec5657950f504175a895e1e3f3c", "ja": "わたくしどものメインビジュアルは、\n貴女様にお願いしたいと思っているんですよ～。", "zh": "我们这边的主要视觉图，\n其实很希望能拜托您来担任呢～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0440_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0440_story_02_1052_034ayu", "source_sha256": "e3a5318cdecdee589b7ea66e62eb8b65c1dae32d4dc1bdffbf587068ed35b0e9", "ja": "おおーっ！　やったね可憐、大抜擢じゃん！\n……可憐？　おーい？", "zh": "哦——！太好了，可怜，你这是被破格选中了呀！\n……可怜？喂——？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0440_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0440_story_02_1053_021mat", "source_sha256": "d5d296e6272494acbd4c3b0ffd4509284106bb65197414a671c82336ae5e4dd3", "ja": "ほ！？　大変、立ったまま気絶しているのです！\n歩ちゃん、そっち側を支えるのですよ！", "zh": "咦！？不好了，她居然站着昏过去了！\n步，你扶住那边哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0440_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0440_story_02_1054_p", "source_sha256": "9f35caa12779b423e5a13bd080cd5619cab1741a8054d3a86b31bab99b19fc4d", "ja": "（……という具合に、両陣営の準備が整った。\nさあ、華やかな勝負の始まりだ！）", "zh": "（……就这样，双方都准备就绪了。那么，华丽的对决开始了！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
